        </div>

        <hr>
        <div class="alert alert-info py-2 small">
            <i class="fas fa-truck"></i> <strong>Note:</strong> After saving this raw material,
            go to <strong>"ADD DELIVERY (BATCH)"</strong> to add stock with price and expiry date.
